0-8dcc-0ee26f5d8172","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/MASA1201t/status/1433735398774108167|https://twitter.com/MASA1201t/status/1433735398774108167\u003e","ts":"1630836682.267300","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/MASA1201t|@MASA1201t\u003e: イスラエルが人口当たり新規感染者数で世界一に\n3回目接種が世界一進んでいるワクチン大国がコロナ感染率で堂々の世界首位\n\u003chttps://www.dailymail.co.uk/news/article-9951117/Israel-worlds-Covid-hotspot-0-2-population-catching-yesterday.html\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"まーちゃ","author_subname":"@MASA1201t","author_link":"https://twitter.com/MASA1201t/status/1433735398774108167","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1386018527631478786/m_VqKXFH_normal.jpg","text":"イスラエルが人口当たり新規感染者数で世界一に\n3回目接種が世界一進んでいるワクチン大国がコロナ感染率で堂々の世界首位\n\u003chttps://www.dailymail.co.uk/news/article-9951117/Israel-worlds-Covid-hotspot-0-2-population-catching-yesterday.html\u003e","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1630664131,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/MASA1201t/status/1433735398774108167","original_url":"https://twitter.com/MASA1201t/status/1433735398774108167"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pB3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d94fff2e-efca-4891-b994-c89cb9b4d8cc","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"これ封じ込められるのか？","ts":"1630836652.267100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UAF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"89ee8d0f-3150-441d-bac1-810000d4a716","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"イスラエルで感染者むちゃくちゃ増えてるのがワクチン接種の限界を感じる","ts":"1630836644.266800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JGM=="}]},{"client_msg_id":"7f07ee17-a72e-4cd3-b2e7-7337429f15cf","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"厳密には感染とその増殖自体が症状と=じゃないから、面倒なことになってる、らしい","ts":"1630835853.266200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Juk="}]},{"client_msg_id":"d95e4d60-fb81-43aa-9adb-26cd1e4f4a02","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"そして当面はワクチン打っても菌を受けない/出さない施策が必要\n(いろいろ言ってるけどウィルスなんだけどね)","ts":"1630835827.265700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IgS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4f4dc7c0-3fd9-48bc-b14b-522f0b0fbebd","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"殺意マシマシのくせに感染力も強いのほんとなんなんだこいつ","ts":"1630835825.265500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pC5ka"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d1b67f49-1bcc-4cb3-9e47-eb5f61c8c0f5","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"菌が増えないほどに強いと感染させることもないんだけど、さすがにそうもいかないからね","ts":"1630835796.264600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vlf6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2b3414d0-6053-4ffd-973e-9722df350b1e","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"なのでワクチン打ってもなるべくなら出ないのが正解なんですよね\n少なくとも集団免疫が充分になるまでは","ts":"1630835783.264000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"957Av"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7e2cc897-65bd-410d-8d3f-316bc21dbdb3","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"感染と発症と人に移す状態と保菌の概念","ts":"1630835739.263100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9l1H="}]},{"client_msg_id":"fd71134e-a1f4-4156-957a-b77c118cd6d3","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"つまるところ、抗力がつよくて、無自覚保菌者になるってことですからね","ts":"1630835718.262700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=df"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6322a0ce-bc63-4aa9-9a0b-67c9587f62cd","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"なるほど。ブレークスルー感染だと本人に症状が出ないことが多いらしいよね","ts":"1630835686.261700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H4sS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3020bbea-b665-4eb1-8210-1d179e6f56da","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"正しく動くために、の情報共有\n\u003chttps://www.kiyohara-keiko.org/view/413\u003e","ts":"1630834359.260900","attachments":[{"fallback":"清原慶子 Official Website: 新型コロナウイルスに感染し、無症状での自宅療養の経験から考える事　その１","id":1,"title":"新型コロナウイルスに感染し、無症状での自宅療養の経験から考える事　その１","title_link":"https://www.kiyohara-keiko.org/view/413","text":"PCR検査で陽性となりました 今年の夏、私は新型コロナウイルス感染者の「濃厚接触者」となり、直ちに「かかりつけ医」にPCR検査をしていただきました。 すると、一回目では正式な検査結果が出ず、再検査の結果、最終的に陽性と診断されました。 その時私は発熱も咳や鼻水などの症状も全くなく、新型コロナウイルスの特徴として有名な味覚・嗅覚障害もまったく出ていない状況で、正直に申しまして、文字通り「狐につままれた気分」でした。 しかし、同時に私が無症状であったことから、誰かに感染させてはいないかという強烈な責任感と不安感に見舞われました。 そこで、直ちに検査結果が出る日までの２週間の行動を振り...","image_url":"https://www.kiyohara-keiko.org/files/entry_images/413/20200303-0.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"清原慶子 Official Website","from_url":"https://www.kiyohara-keiko.org/view/413","original_url":"https://www.kiyohara-keiko.org/view/413"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1Zqs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b7a807df-1aaa-4f92-aa1d-6002be98b871","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"なるほどね、何でここまで効果が薄いのかと思っていた","ts":"1630817752.260600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nZvZB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"471eeaa4-5bfe-4a00-87ea-04203ea393fa","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"デルタ株だと一回接種は効きにくいらしい","ts":"1630817732.260100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R6a+f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3a755031-ab7f-43de-ab6a-e6bf428b3828","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"\u003chttps://gendai.ismedia.jp/articles/-/86480?page=8|https://gendai.ismedia.jp/articles/-/86480?page=8\u003e","ts":"1630817717.259500","attachments":[{"fallback":"マネー現代: コロナワクチン「効きづらい人の共通点」「ラムダ株などへの有効性」など…最新研究結果を一挙紹介！（村上 和巳） @moneygendai","id":1,"title":"コロナワクチン「効きづらい人の共通点」「ラムダ株などへの有効性」など…最新研究結果を一挙紹介！（村上 和巳） @moneygendai","title_link":"https://gendai.ismedia.jp/articles/-/86480?page=8","text":"新型コロナウイルスの感染爆発が止まらない中、ワクチンへの不信感が聞こえるようになってきた。ワクチンをめぐる間違った情報なども錯綜する中で、いまこそワクチンの正しい知識を持つことの重要性が増しているといえる。前編記事ではファイザーワクチンとモデルナワクチンの違い、ワクチンの中長期的な安全性などについて紹介したが、今回はさらに最新の研究結果を一挙紹介する。","image_url":"https://gendai.ismedia.jp/mwimgs/f/e/-/img_fe119b44fd31bfba9f7edd40a2a6e7c142661.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"マネー現代","service_icon":"https://gendai.ismedia.jp/common/money-gendai/images/icons/apple-touch-icon.png","from_url":"https://gendai.ismedia.jp/articles/-/86480?page=8","original_url":"https://gendai.ismedia.jp/articles/-/86480?page=8"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SEEQJ"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U02E4DQS61E","text":"\u003c@U02E4DQS61E\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1630813015.259300","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"deb44099-8769-435e-a9a5-cb81d852d50a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"今回はあまり散歩してませんが\n\u003chttps://flic.kr/p/2mmgCMG\u003e\nパラリンピックのバッジコンプリート","ts":"1630812866.259000","attachments":[{"fallback":"Flickr Photo: 2021-09-05 09.40.41","id":1,"author_name":"Tsuyoshi CHO","author_link":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/tsuyoshi_cho/","title":"2021-09-05 09.40.41","title_link":"https://flic.kr/p/2mmgCMG","image_url":"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/51425208258_0188c8738b_b.jpg","thumb_url":"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/51425208258_0188c8738b_q.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"Flickr","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/flickr.png","thumb_width":150,"thumb_height":150,"from_url":"https://flic.kr/p/2mmgCMG","original_url":"https://flic.kr/p/2mmgCMG"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_